@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK SC"
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam ArrowColor #40526B
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.4
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #557CAD
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #E6EEF9
skinparam ParticipantFontColor #17202B
skinparam BoxBorderColor #CBD6E4
skinparam BoxBackgroundColor #FBFCFD
skinparam NoteBorderColor #D8AD31
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF8DF

title 小腻 Notify Bucket 与 Runtime Loop

participant "外部 / 自注入\nNapCat / self / presence" as Source #DCF2EE
queue "Notify Bucket\n概念入口\n(agent_queue_messages 承载)" as Bucket #E6EEF9
participant "小腻主 loop\nagent-service" as Loop #FFF2C8
database "QQ 正文 inbox\nagent_inbound_messages" as Inbox #E6EEF9
participant "OpenAI\nLLM / image" as OpenAI #E8F5DF
participant "provider-service\nLLM / QQ outbound" as Provider #F5E4F2
participant "xiaoni-executor" as Executor #E5F7F2
database "历史 / trace\nreplay / conversation" as Store #E6EEF9

note over Bucket
回灌目标是概念上的 Notify Bucket，
不是直接把箭头画到某张表。
agent_queue_messages 只是当前持久化/lease 实现细节。
end note

== notify 注入 ==
Source -> Bucket : push notify\nphone_notification / self_continuation / system event
Source -> Inbox : QQ 正文另存\n不是 notify queue

== 小腻主 loop ==
Loop -> Loop : Step 1 loop tick
Loop -> Loop : Step 2 build prompt\nStep 3 build dev\nStep 4 append hist event
Loop -> Bucket : Step 5 non-blocking pick
Bucket --> Loop : maybe notify event\n没有 notify 也继续
Loop -> Loop : Step 6 combined finish
Loop -> Provider : Step 7 execute POST\n/api/internal/agent/execute
Provider -> OpenAI : codex-provider -> OpenAI
OpenAI --> Provider : assistant response / tool_call
Provider --> Loop : parsed response

== Step 8 动作分发 ==
alt $qq-usage
  Loop -> Inbox : read QQ body
  Inbox --> Loop : body as tool output
else reply
  Loop -> Provider : send via NapCat
  Provider --> Loop : delivery state
else exec_command
  Loop -> Executor : exec_command
  Executor --> Loop : stdout / stderr / session
else image / provider task
  Loop -> Provider : start image/provider task
  Provider -> OpenAI : image generation request
  OpenAI --> Provider : image finish
  Provider -> Bucket : push completion notify\n回灌 Notify Bucket
  note right of Bucket
    下一轮仍然由 Step 5 pick，
    不是直接塞进 prompt。
  end note
else message / silent / final
  Loop -> Loop : no external tool
end

== 保存并延续 ==
Loop -> Store : Step 9/10 post-action + save\ntranscript / replay / trace
Loop -> Loop : next loop tick

@enduml
